    "head_ref": "token-library/component-documentation",
    "body": "## Summary\n- Implements [ADR 22](docs/decisions/0022-component-documentation-layers.md) across **components-foundation** and **components-fast**: `*.documentation.ts`, `*.web.binding.ts`, generated `*.generated.ts`, and FAST templates using `documentationToComponentAnatomy`.\n- Extends adaptive-ui contract generation and markdown export; adds shared `labelled` / `text-input` / `content-labelled` documentation includes.\n- Finishes remaining components (dialog, tooltip, tree, data grid family, calendar, card) and removes hand-written `*Conditions` / duplicate part maps from FAST templates.\n\n## Test plan\n- [ ] `npm run build`, `npm test`, and `npm run lint` in `packages/components-foundation`\n- [ ] `npm run build` and `npm run lint` in `packages/components-fast`\n- [ ] `npm test` in `packages/adaptive-ui`\n- [ ] `scripts/check-each-commit.sh 7ae3fd90` (API reports per commit)\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)",
